## ⚠️ A Quick Warning for Long Automations
If you leave a bug bounty script (like your negative counter test) running in a loop with the laptop lid closed, keep the laptop in a well-ventilated area. Laptops dissipate a large amount of heat through the keyboard face. Closing the lid restricts that airflow and can cause the system to run hot during intensive loops. [7] 
